---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Welcome">
  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h1>Hereya Fullstack Serverless Template</h1>
    <p class="text-neutral-600">
      Minimal serverless starter: a static landing, a public registration form,
      an admin page, and an MCP server so AI agents can drive the app on your
      behalf. Anything beyond this lives in <code>docs/patterns/</code>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2>Try it</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
      <li class="rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-3">
        <a href="/register" class="font-medium">/register</a>
        <span class="ml-1 text-neutral-600">
          — public registration form (email + optional name). No auth.
        </span>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-3">
        <a href="/login" class="font-medium">/login</a>
        <span class="ml-1 text-neutral-600">
          — passwordless email-OTP sign-in. The first visitor becomes admin;
          everyone else must be pre-added by an admin.
        </span>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-3">
        <a href="/admin/users" class="font-medium">/admin/users</a>
        <span class="ml-1 text-neutral-600">
          — admin: manage users, registrations, MCP integrations.
        </span>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-3">
        <code class="font-medium">/mcp</code>
        <span class="ml-1 text-neutral-600">
          — MCP server for AI agents. Connect from Claude Desktop or similar.
        </span>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-3">
        <a href="/about" class="font-medium">/about</a>
        <span class="ml-1 text-neutral-600">— public static page.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
